{"seq":9,"slug":"mobile-cicd-release","title":"移动端发布工程","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release","rating":{"composite":3.85,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.7,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 移动端发布工程 简介\n\n移动端发布工程是连接代码开发与用户体验的关键桥梁。不同于 Web 应用的即时部署，移动应用的发布受限于应用商店审核机制、设备碎片化以及客户端二进制分发的不可逆性，这使得发布工程在移动开发体系中占据核心位置。\n\n本知识库面向具备一定 iOS/Android 开发经验、希望系统掌握移动端 CI/CD 与发布全流程的工程师。内容覆盖从代码提交到用户手中的完整链路，兼顾 iOS 与 Android 双平台的技术差异与共性实践。\n\n**第一章 构建流水线与包管理** 深入构建系统的底层架构，讨论 Xcode Build System、Gradle Build 的核心原理，以及二进制产物缓存、构建可复现性等工程实践。\n\n**第二章 发布策略与灰度放量** 聚焦发布决策层面，涵盖分阶段灰度发布的策略设计、App Store / Google Play 的提审流程与审核应对，以及功能开关驱动的渐进式发布。\n\n**第三章 质量门禁与自动化回归** 构建发布前的质量防线，包括自动化测试体系、包体积监控与瘦身治理、崩溃率门禁等发布拦截机制。\n\n**第四章 热修复与回滚机制** 应对线上紧急问题，对比 iOS/Android 主流热修复方案，设计回滚策略与版本管理体系，建立发布事故的响应与复盘机制。\n\n推荐学习路径：先建立构建流水线的全局认知，再理解发布策略的决策逻辑，然后掌握质量门禁的防护体系，最后学习热修复与回滚的应急手段。四个章节层层递进，共同构成移动端发布工程的完整知识图谱。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"build-pipeline","title":"构建流水线与包管理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release/build-pipeline","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"build-system-architecture","title":"构建系统架构与依赖管理","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release/build-pipeline/build-system-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"binary-artifact-management","title":"二进制产物管理与缓存加速","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release/build-pipeline/binary-artifact-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"build-reproducibility","title":"构建可复现性与环境一致性","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release/build-pipeline/build-reproducibility"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"release-strategy","title":"发布策略与灰度放量","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release/release-strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"phased-rollout","title":"分阶段灰度发布策略","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release/release-strategy/phased-rollout"},{"seq":2,"slug":"app-store-submission","title":"应用商店提审与审核应对","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release/release-strategy/app-store-submission"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-flags-remote-config","title":"功能开关与远程配置","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release/release-strategy/feature-flags-remote-config"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"quality-gate","title":"质量门禁与自动化回归","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release/quality-gate","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pre-release-testing","title":"发布前自动化测试体系","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release/quality-gate/pre-release-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"binary-size-monitoring","title":"包体积监控与瘦身治理","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release/quality-gate/binary-size-monitoring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"crash-rate-gate","title":"崩溃率门禁与发布拦截","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release/quality-gate/crash-rate-gate"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"hotfix-rollback","title":"热修复与回滚机制","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release/hotfix-rollback","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hotpatch-technology","title":"热修复技术方案对比","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release/hotfix-rollback/hotpatch-technology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rollback-strategy","title":"回滚策略与版本管理","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release/hotfix-rollback/rollback-strategy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"incident-response-release","title":"发布事故响应与复盘","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-cicd-release/hotfix-rollback/incident-response-release"}]}]}